    "title": "AOGA Announces 2026 Industry Award Winners - NewsBreak",
    "text": "13 hours ago On the eve of its annual conference in Anchorage, the Alaska Oil and Gas Association (AOGA) announced the individuals and companies honored with the 2026 AOGA Industry Awards. The professional trade association is giving out four awards, two recognizing organizations for outstanding performance and two individuals: a rising star making early impact in the industry and a person who has made a career of industry support. Read full article\n1",
